xt":"I guess I wanna recreate the atmosphere we had before.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alonesurviver_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alonesurviver_01_22","text":"Hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alonesurviver_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"neve","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alonesurviver_01_23","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alonesurviver_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"neve","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alonesurviver_01_24","text":"Well, if that's what makes you happy,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alonesurviver_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"neve","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alonesurviver_01_25","text":"then I appreciate the invitation.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alonesurviver_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alonesurviver_01_26","text":"Thanks for understanding :D","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alonesurviver_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alonesurviver_01_27","text":"It's always nice having a new group chat!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alonesurviver_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alonesurviver_01_28","text":"Queen says it's not bad to have a new chat too! C:","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alonesurviver_01_29","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alonesurviver_01_29","text":"You seem to be rubbing off on Ludmilla, Alice.","jump":"m_ex_alonesurviver_01_31"},{"id":"m_ex_alonesurviver_01_30","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alonesurviver_01_30","text":"It's nice to see Ludmilla embracing her lovable side.","jump":"m_ex_alonesurviver_01_35"},{"id":"m_ex_alonesurviver_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alonesurviver_01_31","text":"Wow!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alonesurviver_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alonesurviver_01_32","text":"Yeesh,","jump":null},{